      "alt": "lbox1012al box pc",
      "text": "<h1>Based on the QorIQ LS1012A processor for a cost-effective and small solution platform</h1>\r\n<p>The QorIQ LS1012A is a versatile embedded system powered by the QorIQ LS1012A processor. It's designed to excel in applications that require high processing power and networking capabilities. With up to 1 GB of DDR3L memory and a generous Quad SPI NOR flash capacity of up to 256 MB, it ensures efficient data handling and storage. This system offers multiple communication interfaces, including Ethernet, USB, UART, SATA, SD Card, I2C, GPIO, PCIe, and more. Operating within a wide temperature range and with Linux support, it's well-suited for diverse industrial applications.</p>\r\n",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Sep 17 2026 19:07:35 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
